          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:2-3 Taz Rom 9:13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:2-5 Taz Isa 34:5-17; 63:1-6; Yer 49:7-22; Eze 25:12-14; 35:1-15; Amo 1:11-12; Oba 1-14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu asema: “Daima nimewapenda nyinyi”. Lakini watu wa Israeli wanauliza, “Umetupendaje?” Naye Mwenyezi-Mungu asema: “Je, Esau hakuwa ndugu yake Yakobo? Hata hivyo nilimpenda Yakobo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikamchukia Esau. Nimeiharibu nchi ya milima ya Esau ambayo ni urithi wake, nikawaachia mbwamwitu wa jangwani. Nao wazawa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa Esau, yaani Waedomu, wanasema kwamba ingawa miji yao imeharibiwa, watajenga upya magofu yake. Lakini, mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi nasema kwamba wanaweza kuijenga upya, lakini mimi nitaibomolea mbali. Watu watawaita, ‘Taifa ovu ambalo Mwenyezi-Mungu amelikasirikia milele.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanyi mtakapoyaona hayo kwa macho yenu, mtatambua na kusema: ‘Ukuu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu wafika hata nje ya mipaka ya nchi ya Israeli.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi anawaambia hivi nyinyi makuhani mnaolidharau jina lake: “Mtoto humheshimu mzazi wake, na mtumishi humheshimu bwana wake. Ikiwa mimi ndiye Baba yenu, mbona mwanivunjia heshima? Ikiwa mimi ni bwana wenu, mbona hamniheshimu? Nanyi mnauliza, ‘Sisi tumekudharauje?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanidharau kwa kunitolea madhabahuni pangu tambiko ya chakula najisi. Lakini nyinyi mnauliza, ‘Tumekitiaje najisi?’ Mnakitia najisi kwa kuidharau madhabahu yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Kumb 15:21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mnaponitolea tambiko ya mnyama kipofu, au kilema, au mgonjwa, je, huo si uovu? Je, mtawala atapendezwa au kukufanyia hisani ukimpa zawadi ya mnyama kama huyo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo sasa enyi makuhani, mwombeni Mungu ili atuhurumie. Ikiwa mnamtolea matoleo ya aina hiyo, je, kweli atakuwa radhi nanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi asema, “Laiti angepatikana mtu mmoja miongoni mwenu ambaye angefunga milango ya hekalu ili msiwashe moto usiokubalika kwenye madhabahu yangu! Sipendezwi nanyi na sitaikubali tambiko yoyote mnayonitolea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wa mataifa kote duniani, toka mawio ya jua hadi machweo yake, wanalitukuza jina langu. Kila mahali wananifukizia ubani na kunitolea tambiko zinazokubalika; maana jina langu linatukuzwa miongoni mwao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini nyinyi mnalibeza jina langu pale mnapoichafua madhabahu yangu, na chakula mnachotoa juu yake mnakidharau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnasema, ‘Mambo haya yametuchosha mno,’ na mnanidharau. Mnaniletea tambiko za wanyama mliowapata kwa unyang'anyi, au walio vilema au wagonjwa. Je, nipokee tambiko hizo mikononi mwenu? Mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nauliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na alaaniwe mtu yeyote anidanganyaye, ambaye huahidi kwa kiapo kunitolea tambiko mnyama safi kutoka katika kundi lake, lakini hunitolea tambiko mnyama mwenye kilema. Tazama, mimi ni mfalme mkuu, na watu wa mataifa yote hunicha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
